---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ISO 14064 Verification Services | Eurocert"
  description="Eurocert provides iso 14064 verification services covering requirements, evidence review, verification steps, documentation and independent assessment."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/management-system/iso-14064/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784092045/GHG_gnfhcv.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="ISO 14064 GHG Management"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Greenhouse Gas quantification, monitoring, reporting &amp; verification</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">ISO 14064  -  GHG Management</h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Credible GHG accounting and verification at organizational and project levels.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Carbon Foot Print Assessment  -  <span class="text-euro-600">ISO 14064</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Carbon Foot Print assessment is now a concern for all stakeholders involved in the issue of climate change. It is fundamental for managing greenhouse gases. Green House Gases are mainly CO2, methane, nitrous oxide and ozone.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">It is required by companies that are involved in GHG emissions trading according 2003/87/EC or in national emission reduction projects. But more and more other companies who have a socially responsible goal are seeking verification. Third-party verification is necessary to establish the credibility of the reported reductions.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-industry text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Applicable Sectors</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Carbon foot print assessment refers mostly to cement factories, pulp and paper producing installations, ceramic product factories, lime production installations, mineral oil refineries and also activities that include combustion emissions or airline companies, but the list of related sectors is expanding. However, ISO 14064, a voluntary standard may be applied for all companies.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784092310/GHG1_yznd0k.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="ISO 14064 Carbon Footprint Assessment"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Verification Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of Carbon Footprint <span class="text-euro-600">Verification</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-gavel text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Legal Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Achieve and demonstrate legal compliance in areas of the world where verification is a legal requirement.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-exchange-alt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Emission Trading</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Allow for the company to participate in emission trading schemes.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shoe-prints text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Carbon Footprint</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Identify operational carbon footprint and opportunities for reduction.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Energy Optimisation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Identify opportunities for energy consumption and optimisation of energy efficiency.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-users text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Stakeholder Disclosure</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Present credible disclosure to stakeholders and investors.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-user-shield text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Personnel Awareness</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Increase of energy and environmental awareness among personnel.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Management Commitment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Demonstrate management commitment to environmental responsibility.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Corporate Image</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Improvement of corporate image through verified environmental performance.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">ISO 14064 <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 14064-1 Implementation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Development and implementation of organization-level GHG inventories in accordance with ISO 14064-1 requirements, covering all emission sources and sinks.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-project-diagram text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 14064-2 Project Certification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Quantification and certification of GHG emission reduction projects, enabling you to demonstrate measurable environmental improvements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-search text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 14064-3 Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Independent third-party verification of GHG inventories and project claims, providing credibility and assurance to your environmental reporting.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-database text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">GHG Inventory Development</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive assessment and documentation of all GHG emission sources and sinks across your organization&#x27;s operations and value chain.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Data Collection &amp; Analysis</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Systematic collection, validation, and analysis of emission data using robust methodologies to ensure accuracy and completeness of your GHG inventory.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Reporting &amp; Documentation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Preparation of ISO 14064-compliant GHG reports and documentation that meet regulatory requirements and stakeholder expectations.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training &amp; Capacity Building</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Training programs for your team on ISO 14064 requirements, GHG accounting methodologies, and implementation best practices.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous support for maintaining and improving your GHG management system, including surveillance audits and updated reporting guidance.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Verification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Certify with Eurocert?</h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">About Eurocert</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body. Through this affiliation, clients benefit from internationally recognised accreditation, a worldwide footprint, and highly trained auditors with deep expertise in greenhouse gas inventories, ISO 14064 reporting and verification, and emissions-related conformity assessment.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Our Expertise</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Eurocert has earned recognition by conducting Verification of Greenhouse Gas Emissions data for well-known companies for many years.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">Verification by Eurocert means evaluation and acceptance by an accredited and well-respected third-party professional organization.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 mt-8 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="text-eurogold-400 font-bold">We are offering above services on behalf of Eurocert S.A</span>  -  a Pan-European Certification body operating from Athens with global reach.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">ACCREDITED</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font"><a href="/accreditations/" class="hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">Independent Third-Party Audits</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/sustainability/carbon-footprint/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367761/eurocert/s2.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Carbon Footprint</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">GHG Assessment Services</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/sustainability/certifications/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367781/eurocert/s3.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Sustainability Certifications</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Environmental Certifications</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-14001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367542/eurocert/m3.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 14001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Environmental Management</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Get Certified</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Quick Inquiry</h2><p class="text-white/45 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Our GHG management experts are ready to guide your organization through ISO 14064 certification.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get Started <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-phone text-[9px]"></i> Call Us Now</a></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
